[Desktop Entry]
Name=Luxus
Comment=Crea unidades USB autoarrancables de Linux, Windows y FreeDOS de forma rápida y segura
Comment[en]=Create bootable Linux, Windows and FreeDOS USB drives fast and safely
Exec=/usr/local/bin/luxus
